{"h":2857,"w":2400,"lines":[{"w":0.32525950113932289,"h":0.017608670607740962,"t":"hypothetical takeover by super-intelligent","c":1,"x":0.19204153269158411,"y":0.098670398553670768},{"t":"robots. Similarly, Rodney Brooks, professor","w":0.342560551961263,"c":1,"y":0.11756473083692642,"x":0.19204152326067545,"h":0.019063176101033252},{"h":0.01470372858708191,"c":1,"t":"of robotics at Massachusetts Institute","y":0.13645906233841898,"w":0.29584775288899734,"x":0.19204152138635408},{"t":"of Technology, writes that 'almost all","x":0.19176948955297887,"h":0.021927726777639323,"y":0.15135749088707851,"c":1,"w":0.29291183471679694},{"w":0.34309898376464848,"y":0.16872056393575174,"c":1,"t":"innovations in robotics and AI take far, far,","x":0.1900941895312685,"h":0.023276487207646301},{"t":"longer to be really widely deployed than","x":0.19031141698220636,"y":0.19174247718632698,"w":0.31487889607747399,"h":0.01610635993695908,"c":1},{"x":0.19171357857177071,"w":0.30337384541829426,"y":0.20678594122619109,"t":"people in the field and outside the field","h":0.02156695158353128,"c":1},{"t":"imagine'.","y":0.2280086904373344,"h":0.017819828383150105,"c":1,"w":0.076246255238850924,"x":0.19025057471204454},{"t":"One of the many difficulties in deploying","c":1,"h":0.017494751574527734,"x":0.19377162334965722,"y":0.26452064371848993,"w":0.3183391062418619},{"y":0.28188548306060213,"x":0.19193412478256477,"c":1,"w":0.29605730692545573,"h":0.018447718476815478,"t":"machine learning systems is that Al is"},{"x":0.19192363381119462,"h":0.019048664101025903,"y":0.30024243811684959,"c":1,"w":0.3410392506917318,"t":"extremely susceptible to adversarial attacks."},{"w":0.32887702941894525,"h":0.017307148019778618,"x":0.19197153484713256,"y":0.31857458934166538,"t":"This means that a malicious Al can target","c":1},{"t":"another AI to make it behave in a certain","h":0.018688779848284431,"w":0.32205014546712241,"c":1,"x":0.19188876689134096,"y":0.33560563970334156},{"w":0.29260541280110675,"x":0.1936597258067301,"h":0.020041861510760706,"c":1,"t":"way, such as forcing it to make wrong","y":0.35516556808673805},{"x":0.19204152580008402,"y":0.37499999971570797,"w":0.33564013163248696,"h":0.017582225332400281,"c":1,"t":"predictions. Many researchers have warned"},{"h":0.015988371937820545,"w":0.28892733256022129,"y":0.39389534890884492,"x":0.19204152394415724,"t":"against the rolling out of Al without","c":1},{"h":0.02009610549147256,"c":1,"y":0.40925665139585821,"x":0.19184857838072683,"w":0.33771263122558598,"t":"appropriate security standards and defence"},{"x":0.19204152584155773,"h":0.015988371937820656,"y":0.43023255821158468,"w":0.3010380554199219,"c":1,"t":"mechanisms. Still, AI security remains"},{"y":0.44611616538054877,"w":0.32006919860839844,"c":1,"h":0.0190001134692247,"x":0.19204152579960701,"t":"an often overlooked topic when machine"},{"y":0.46641007709306836,"t":"learning systems are installed.","x":0.19031141958166869,"w":0.23875432332356772,"c":1,"h":0.017601551085272504},{"x":0.19204152007144917,"h":0.017549676941857606,"c":1,"w":0.33391003926595053,"t":"If we are to reap the benefits and minimise","y":0.50279916054191032},{"w":0.31833910624186196,"x":0.19204151944181963,"h":0.017550694683867829,"y":0.52169349162816603,"c":1,"t":"the potential harms of Al, we must start"},{"w":0.32698961893717449,"y":0.53918824330489712,"t":"thinking about how machine learning can","x":0.19204152279784878,"c":1,"h":0.017497803465814532},{"c":1,"t":"be meaningfully applied to specific areas","x":0.19189252754585748,"w":0.31862648010253902,"y":0.55611306716125408,"h":0.021014664037983355},{"y":0.57346512299728603,"w":0.32561988830566402,"c":1,"h":0.022132858852976445,"t":"of government, business and society. This","x":0.19357559354905685},{"t":"means we need to have a discussion about AI","w":0.35294118245442707,"h":0.01469559132260323,"x":0.19204151952498838,"y":0.59447165857179207,"c":1},{"y":0.61336599029101979,"w":0.35294118245442707,"h":0.017494751574527623,"c":1,"t":"ethics and the distrust that many people have","x":0.19204151941242487},{"c":1,"x":0.19184013528655952,"w":0.21326583862304688,"t":"towards machine learning.","y":0.63029946841787821,"h":0.018237214725780104},{"t":"Most importantly, we need to be aware of","w":0.32887669881184889,"c":1,"y":0.66710302647937603,"h":0.018172330836301986,"x":0.19198423797677408},{"c":1,"x":0.19357274886286319,"t":"the limitations of Al and where people still","y":0.68399400728347526,"w":0.33599032084147135,"h":0.020383579902835791},{"h":0.019040799124245833,"y":0.7018894331666613,"x":0.19377162836624023,"c":1,"w":0.34602076212565108,"t":"need to take the lead. Instead of painting an"},{"w":0.33239158630371091,"y":0.72083974457873001,"h":0.020731815848006874,"c":1,"t":"unrealistic picture of the power of AI, it is","x":0.19365460475384841},{"w":0.3373702494303385,"c":1,"t":"important to take a step back and separate","x":0.19031141496809739,"y":0.74127906948237698,"h":0.01744186102384615},{"t":"the actual technological capabilities of AI","x":0.19377162645503102,"w":0.32698961893717449,"c":1,"y":0.76017441867685109,"h":0.015988371937820545},{"t":"from fantasy.","y":0.77702888787814139,"h":0.019938266719446984,"c":1,"x":0.19137012668107176,"w":0.10688625335693361},{"w":0.071458466847737601,"x":0.84333580228711358,"y":0.047782687162497783,"h":0.021165803731780786,"c":1,"t":"Reading"},{"w":0.33564013163248696,"t":"The medical profession has also recognised","x":0.56228374034424011,"y":0.09867039876617445,"h":0.017608671275112786,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.33564013163248685,"t":"the drawbacks to AI. The IBM Watson for","y":0.11756473088647279,"h":0.016156199263725468,"x":0.56055363652454593},{"h":0.01895637659028826,"y":0.13365990221224677,"x":0.56228374375304113,"w":0.34775085449218757,"c":1,"t":"Oncology programme was a piece of AI that"},{"c":1,"t":"was meant to help doctors treat cancer. Even","x":0.56228373525437914,"y":0.15395381366304739,"h":0.016104325787682283,"w":0.34948097229003905},{"x":0.56219174796038618,"y":0.17133977660519228,"c":1,"w":0.33408854166666668,"t":"though it was developed to deliver the best","h":0.018465031436308843},{"w":0.31660898844401031,"h":0.016095171448565426,"c":1,"t":"recommendations, human experts found","x":0.56055363722335239,"y":0.19034289710867869},{"h":0.02002071783707815,"w":0.31527343749999992,"x":0.56038473012990764,"c":1,"y":0.20683223540431239,"t":"it hard to trust the machine. As a result,"},{"c":1,"w":0.33588144938151043,"h":0.02099300782275082,"t":"the AI programme was abandoned in most","x":0.5621565364834652,"y":0.22497403629216861},{"w":0.24221453348795574,"h":0.017494751574527623,"t":"hospitals where it was trialled.","x":0.56228373664120757,"c":1,"y":0.245626311958968},{"w":0.34256055196126312,"x":0.56228373777965956,"h":0.01613382228693816,"c":1,"y":0.2819767442590535,"t":"Similar difficulties arose in the legal domain"},{"t":"when algorithms were used in courts in the","y":0.29855441775567693,"h":0.01881952599431358,"c":1,"x":0.56215039051976678,"w":0.33415822347005208},{"w":0.308188247680664,"y":0.31695981081625257,"x":0.5621666125821928,"t":"US to sentence criminals. An algorithm","c":1,"h":0.019192135692727263},{"w":0.29238754272460943,"h":0.014534884186538477,"c":1,"y":0.33720930208769506,"t":"calculated risk assessment scores and","x":0.56055363340878916},{"h":0.017441859689102612,"w":0.35121106465657559,"t":"advised judges on the sentencing. The system","x":0.56228374204887488,"y":0.3546511630042859,"c":1},{"y":0.37182751992060503,"w":0.29627924601236977,"h":0.021083943238201619,"c":1,"t":"was found to amplify structural racial","x":0.562094068098697},{"x":0.56228373398834586,"y":0.39244186022825223,"w":0.31833910624186201,"h":0.014534884186538477,"t":"discrimination and was later abandoned.","c":1},{"x":0.56228374046304941,"t":"There are some crucial lessons here for","y":0.42862141361279815,"c":1,"h":0.01469559132260323,"w":0.3010380554199219},{"t":"everyone aiming to boost investments in","h":0.022648037856404346,"c":1,"y":0.44304239420254843,"w":0.31193471272786455,"x":0.56199647696776256},{"x":0.56228373839952916,"y":0.46501049701401787,"w":0.32352940877278646,"h":0.01754764279258092,"c":1,"t":"national AI programmes. These examples"},{"t":"demonstrate that there is no AI solution","x":0.56209302374191372,"h":0.019972624354966495,"w":0.3134739685058594,"y":0.48082044082596598,"c":1},{"y":0.50139958044175847,"c":1,"x":0.56055362852314683,"w":0.30622838338216141,"h":0.017495768649166021,"t":"for everything. Using AI simply for the"},{"y":0.51860054259898158,"w":0.3410792795817057,"h":0.02044669725913284,"c":1,"t":"sake of AI may not always be productive or","x":0.562157135292365},{"t":"useful, and not every issue is best addressed","y":0.53599698418414787,"c":1,"x":0.56209525944847705,"w":0.33948046366373685,"h":0.02124458697394449},{"y":0.55668299483392925,"w":0.29757784525553388,"t":"by applying machine intelligence to it.","x":0.56228374280475901,"h":0.017494751574527623,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.57412790685449089,"t":"All solutions come with a cost and not","x":0.5622837407588972,"h":0.016145011442703638,"w":0.30103805541992179},{"y":0.59282283066913199,"t":"everything that can be automated should be.","w":0.34618960062662774,"h":0.019544998526656698,"c":1,"x":0.56218320134977173},{"y":0.95058139541849351,"t":"47","x":0.8892733567703256,"h":0.013081395100512871,"w":0.022491348584493087,"c":1}]}